## What this MIT grant covers

Copyright: Kwan Wai-Pang. License: MIT, the text above.

- Hub: `index.html`, `css/`, `js/hub-lobby.js`, `assets/`, root documentation
- Original games with no separate license file:
  `games/go/`, `games/gomoku/`, `games/junqi/`, `games/fps/`,
  `games/redcap/`, `games/wizard-chess-3d/`, `games/wizard-chess-sanctum/`,
  `games/3D_xiangqi/`, `games/richera/`, `games/Hulao_Gate/`

Third-party libraries named in `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` (Three.js, chess.js,
Kenney CC0 assets, and others) keep their own terms even when used inside
these folders.

